Create a Function GET_ANNUAL_SAL that calculates Annual Salary
of an Employee.
Call the function from a SELECT statement for employees in
DEPTNO 30.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION GET_ANNUAL_SAL
(
     P_SAL NUMBER,
     P_COMM NUMBER
)
RETURN NUMBER
IS
BEGIN

     RETURN (P_SAL*12)+NVL(P_COMM,0);

END;
/

