Output:
-------

Employee Inserted.

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.


Execute (Invalid Department):
-----------------------------

sql> EXEC ADD_EMP(9002,'DAVID',18000,99);

Output:
-------

Invalid Department Number.

PL/SQL procedure successfully completed.

