Create a Function CAL_WORDS that converts a numeric value
into Words.
====================================================================

SQL Command:
------------

sql> CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION CAL_WORDS
(
     P_NUM NUMBER
)
RETURN VARCHAR2
IS
BEGIN

     RETURN TO_CHAR
     (
          TO_DATE(P_NUM,'J'),
          'JSP'
     );

END;
/

